                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Plum's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Early vegan / clean-beauty positioning that scaled with the emerging psychographic + ingredient transparency + subscription mechanics.</p>
                                        <h3>Is vegan / clean beauty still a growing category?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — 20-40% YoY growth in India. Similar trajectory in UAE + USA + UK. Category compound continues.</p>
                                        <h3>How does Plum compete with Mamaearth / Sugar / MCaffeine?</h3>
                                        <p>Positioning specialisation — Plum on vegan / clean-beauty, others on their specific angles. Multiple positions coexist in Indian beauty.</p>
